[156.977267, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b[01;32mappuser@fc242f58cc27\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m/app\u001b[00m$ "]
[208.590504, "i", "cat > /app/answer.md <<'EOF'\n# Letter review\n\nThis review weighs every numbered line of the draft letter against the client's original instruction and later clarification, with the clarification prevailing on each subject it addresses. Letter lines at odds with the record: 4. The conflicts concern the addressee, the behavioural plan, the tone, and the copying of the father; the draft otherwise follows the governing entries on the remaining subjects, while a few lines introduce matters that neither message addresses. The per-line findings are set out in `letter_line_review.csv`, and the totals appear in `results.json`.\nEOF\nls -l /app/answer.md /app/letter_line_review.csv /app/results.json\nwc -w /app/answer.md\npython3 -m json.tool /app/results.json >/dev/null && echo \"results.json valid\"\n"]
[208.590957, "o", "cat > /app/answer.md <<'EOF'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
